{"id":"662431","name":"红烧鸡腿","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/662431/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"6只"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱段","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡腿反复洗净，锅中水烧开，放入葱段、姜片、鸡腿焯水。","img":"images/662431/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"焯水至无血水至熟。","img":"images/662431/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"将鸡腿捞出。","img":"images/662431/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放入适量的食用油，放入各种调料炒香，再加入生抽、红烧酱油。","img":"images/662431/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量开水，放入葱段、姜片、及焯好的鸡腿煮制。","img":"images/662431/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入适量的盐使之入味。","img":"images/662431/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入少许红曲粉。","img":"images/662431/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再放入1勺白糖，使口味更好。","img":"images/662431/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"烧至鸡腿已入味且上色。","img":"images/662431/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"停火即可。","img":"images/662431/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"红烧鸡腿颜色红润，肉香味美。","img":"images/662431/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}